/-!
# Data of the global generators (code/selmer-global-bound/sunit_data_lean.gp)

PARI/GP data of sb_5a (tower, roots), sb_5b (generators, cofactors; data file sunit_generators_data.gp), sb_5c
(Pgen, power tables) and sb_5d (residue characters). Every datum below is rechecked from the text of this file
by sunit_data_lean.gp (output sunit_data_lean.out). Lists are split into one def per entry (`gL_0`, ..., `gL_28`, then
`gL := [gL_0, ..., gL_28]`), and likewise `gN`, `gLw`, `gNw`, `pgen`, `alphaPow`, `betaPow`.

Formats (frozen):

* `gL` (29 entries): `[a0, a1]`, zk lists of length 21: the generator `⟨zkE a0, zkE a1⟩` of `L42`.
* `gN` (53 entries): `[a0, a1, b0, b1]`: the generator `⟨⟨zkE a0, zkE a1⟩, ⟨2 zkE b0, 2 zkE b1⟩⟩`
  of `N84`, i.e. `a0 + a1 ω + (b0 + b1 ω) (2 ω_N)`.
* `pgen` (82 entries) with `pgenDen`: the coefficients (constant term first, zk lists) of
  `pgenDen s * Pgen s`, `Pgen s ∈ K21[X]` of degree at most 5.
* `alphaL = [a0, a1]`, `alphaDen`: `α = ⟨zkE a0, zkE a1⟩ / alphaDen ∈ L42`, a root of `q k`.
* `betaN = [a0, a1, b0, b1]`, `betaDen`: `β = ⟨⟨zkE a0, zkE a1⟩, ⟨zkE b0, zkE b1⟩⟩ / betaDen ∈ N84`,
  a root of `h k`.

Membership certificates:

* `gLw` (29 entries, the format of `gL`) and `gLab` (29 pairs `(a, b)`): `mkL (gL s) * mkL (gLw s) = 2 ^ a * 7 ^ b`
  in `L42`.
* `gNw` (53 entries, the format of `gN`) and `gNab` (53 pairs): `mkN (gN s) * mkN (gNw s) = 2 ^ a * 7 ^ b` in `N84`.

Power tables (evaluation of `Pgen s` at `α`, `β`):

* `alphaPow` (6 entries, the format of `gL`): `alphaPow i = (alphaDen α) ^ i`, so
  `Pgen s (α) = ∑ i, pgen s i * alphaPow i / (pgenDen s * alphaDen ^ i)`.
* `betaPow` (6 entries, the format of `gN`) and `betaPowDen = 2 * betaDen`: `betaPow i = (betaPowDen β) ^ i`
  (the coordinates `b` of `(betaDen β) ^ 1` in the format of `gN` are not all integral), so
  `Pgen s (β) = ∑ i, pgen s i * betaPow i / (pgenDen s * betaPowDen ^ i)`.

Residue characters (independence modulo squares, residue_characters.gp):

* `chL` (29 entries `[p, t, s]`), `chN` (53 entries `[p, t, s, t2]`): `p` an odd prime, `p ≠ 7`, `p` prime to `Dz`
  and `DB`; `t` a root of `fL` mod `p`, `ρ (zkE a) = Dz⁻¹ evalL t (combo a zkNum) mod p`; `s² = ρ ε`;
  `t2 ≠ 0`, `t2² = 2 (ρ ea + s ρ eb)`. `ρ_L (a0 + a1 ω) = ρ a0 + s ρ a1`,
  `ρ_N (a0 + a1 ω + (b0 + b1 ω) (2 ω_N)) = ρ_L (a0 + a1 ω) + ρ_L (b0 + b1 ω) t2`.
* `RL`, `RN`: bit `s` of row `j` is set iff `ρ_j (gen s) ^ ((p - 1) / 2) = -1` (every generator is nonzero mod every `p`).
* `TL`, `TN`: left inverses, `leftInvOK RL 29 29 TL`, `leftInvOK RN 53 53 TN` (Echelon.lean).

Certificate of `μ(T)` (mu_t_cert.gp; GlobalCRT.lean, `muT_components`), for `k = 0, 1`:

* `kapT_k` (zk list), `kapTDen_k`: `κ = zkE kapT_k / kapTDen_k ∈ K21^×`; `aT_k`: 82 bits `a s`;
  `y1T_k` (format of `gL`) over `y1TDen_k`, `y2T_k` (format of `gN`) over `y2TDen_k`: with `x1 = -c_k h(α)`,
  `x2 = q(β)`, `x1 ∏_{s < 29} gensL_s ^ (a s) = κ y1²` and `x2 ∏_{s ≥ 29} gensN_(s - 29) ^ (a s) = κ y2²`.
* `prodLT_k` (format of `gL`) `= ∏_{s < 29, a s = 1} gensL_s`, `prodNT_k` (format of `gN`) `= ∏_{s ≥ 29, a s = 1} gensN_(s - 29)`.
* Checked identities (`A = alphaPow 1`, `B = betaPow 1`, `D_L = alphaDen`, `D_N = betaPowDen`):
  `-(FE k 0) [∑ i, hL_i A^i D_L^(4-i)] prodLT kapTDen y1TDen² = 4 hDen D_L^4 kapT y1T²` and
  `[∑ i, qL_i B^i D_N^(2-i)] prodNT kapTDen y2TDen² = qDen D_N² kapT y2T²`.

Every zk list has length exactly 21, every `pgen s` has exactly 6 coefficients, every generator is nonzero.
Order: `gL` is 28 LLL reduced S-units, then `-1`; `gN` is `-1`, then 52 LLL reduced S-units (the positions of the
p21_29 generators they replace, code/earlier-computations/prym_two_descent.gp); `Pgen s` for `s < 29` belongs to
`gL s`, for `s ≥ 29` to `gN (s - 29)`.
-/

